{"sourceUrl":"https://hc.dhu.edu.cn/2024/0911/c22262a380315/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:42.909510+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://hc.dhu.edu.cn/2024/0911/c22262a380315/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>人文学院</span><span><span>第一批</span><span>硕士接收推免生预申请</span><span>截止时间：</span><strong><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日16:00</span><span>。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>申请人可登录东华大学研究生报考服务系统（</span><span>https://yzbm.dhu.edu.cn/logon</span><span>），点击</span><span>“</span><span>全国优秀大学生推免生预报名</span><span>”</span><span>（平台开放时间为工作日</span><span>9</span><span>：</span><span>00-16</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>），进入</span><span>“</span><span>推免预报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>填写并提交申请信息。申请人只可申请一种推荐免试研究生类型（即学术学位或者全日制专业学位）和填报一个申请志愿，申请人在网上提交的信息必须真实、准确、有效，如提供虚假、错误信息或弄虚作假，考生承担由此造成的一切后果。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>审核</span><span><span>通过的同学将于</span><strong><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日</span></strong><span>左右通过邮件告知并发送微信群二维码</span></span><span>，请同学确认邮箱的准确性。</span><span><span>面试时间</span></span><span>暂定</span><span><span>于9</span><span>月</span><span>16-18</span><span>日（具体时间、分组将会通过微信群告知）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>说明：</span></strong><span>第二批</span><span>“</span><span>预推免</span><span>”</span><span>面试将视第一批面试情况而定，请同学们耐心等待通知。</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"20d82dfb0fcecd3e66fe6f11e285c71ce61b82b0761e64562ee3d3c8b4122b55","textLength":355,"sourceSha256":"690a12cc4b20eddeaa6b039a40650ca482bf7baedaa70242ee021d9e93c9290d","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ec74855f1f36464e1ba0","title":"2026年东华大学人文学院硕士接收推免生预申请公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:42.909510+00:00"}
